# Build variables for next build (copy to .env.local). All optional locally.
# Optional: 1 makes a local build indexable (production on Workers Builds is indexable without it)
SITE_INDEXABLE=

# Booking links are not build variables: both Cal.com URLs live in app/booking.json.

# The form Worker's secret is not a build variable. Locally, put it (or FORM_DRY_RUN=1) in .dev.vars, which is
# git-ignored; in production, set SEQUENZY_API_KEY as a secret on the Worker. See README.
